# GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2 — React Router RSC Mode CSRF Bypass.
# Fixed only in react-router@8.3.0 (a breaking major upgrade). Per the advisory,
# this "only affects your application if you are using the unstable RSC APIs" —
# this project builds with ssr: false (SPA mode, see Frontend/react-router.config.ts)
# and never enables the RSC APIs, so the vulnerable code path is not reachable.
GHSA-qwww-vcr4-c8h2
